a platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"HealthTech legal analysis"},{"type":"flow","items":["Technology","Data Collected","Medical / Healthcare Function","Patient Interaction","Regulatory Classification","Privacy","Liability","Consumer Protection","Compliance"]}]},{"heading":"AI in Healthcare","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI creates significant legal questions."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted diagnosis"},{"text":"Clinical decision support"},{"text":"Medical imaging AI"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"AI documentation"},{"text":"AI chatbots"},{"text":"Patient data used for AI"},{"text":"Algorithmic bias"},{"text":"Product liability"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Health Law Consultant should ask:"},{"type":"p","text":"Who is responsible if an AI-assisted healthcare system produces an incorrect recommendation?"},{"type":"p","text":"This requires understanding the interaction between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Technology","Medical Practice","Product Liability","Professional Responsibility","Data Protection"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Legal Research Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Become highly proficient in researching:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statutes"},{"text":"Regulations"},{"text":"Notifications"},{"text":"Government guidance"},{"text":"Court judgments"},{"text":"Regulatory decisions"},{"text":"Professional standards"},{"text":"Healthcare policies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research process"},{"type":"flow","items":["Legal Question","Primary Law","Regulations","Case Law","Regulatory Guidance"]}]},{"heading":"Data & Analytical Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Healthcare legal consulting increasingly benefits from analytical skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"Filters"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Data validation"},